# Change workflow

- Treat `NOTES.md` and planning folders as proposals, not contracts.
- Keep intake and UI in this repo; privileged LLM/tool execution belongs in
  `sajtagent-sprites`.
- Prefer one real browser-to-result slice over parallel mock and production paths.
- `next build` currently ignores existing TypeScript errors; read
  `docs/quality-baseline.md` and never report it as full type verification.
- Read `docs/runtime-baseline.md`; prototype fallbacks must be visibly labeled
  and can never count as backend, preview, publish, or export success.
- When replacing a mock or legacy route, remove it or document its authority,
  owner, and measurable removal trigger.
